{"id":"3D","title":"Honesty and Sincerity","part":{"n":3,"title":"Relationship to Other Persons"},"url":"/law/03-relationship-to-other-persons/3d","entries":[{"id":"3D.1","text":"Honesty is to be provided to everyone and in all things in life you do.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"17"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":8,"verses":"21"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":13,"verses":"7"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":2,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":13,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Rom. 12:17; 2 Cor. 8:21; 2 Cor. 13:7; 1 Tim. 2:2; Heb. 13:18"},{"id":"3D.2","text":"We should think on honest things.","refs":[{"book":"Philippians","chapter":4,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Phil. 4:8."},{"id":"3D.3","text":"Respect what is right and honest in the sight of all men.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Rom. 12:17."},{"id":"3D.4","text":"We are to walk honestly.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":13,"verses":"13"},{"book":"1 Thessalonians","chapter":4,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"Rom. 13:13; 1 Thes. 4:12."},{"id":"3D.5","text":"Sincerity characterizes our love to Christ.","refs":[{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":6,"verses":"24"}],"citation":"Eph. 6:24."},{"id":"3D.6","text":"A godly sincerity should characterize our whole conduct.","refs":[{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":1,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"2 Cor. 1: 12."},{"id":"3D.7","text":"He who is near to God speaks the truth in his heart.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":15,"verses":"1-2"}],"citation":"Psa. 15:1-2."},{"id":"3D.8","text":"Dishonest gain condemned.","refs":[{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":22,"verses":"13,27"}],"citation":"Ezek. 22:13, 27."},{"id":"3D.9","text":"The preaching of the gospel to be with sincerity.","refs":[{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":2,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Philippians","chapter":1,"verses":"16"},{"book":"1 Thessalonians","chapter":2,"verses":"3-5"}],"citation":"2 Cor. 2:17; 1 Phil. 1: 16; Thes. 2:3-5."},{"id":"3D.10","text":"Christians exhorted to be sincere.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":5,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 5:8."},{"id":"3D.11","text":"Those with an honest and good heart hear and keep the word of God and bring forth fruitful work.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":8,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"Luke 8:15."},{"id":"3D.12","text":"We should pray on behalf of others that they may be sincere.","refs":[{"book":"Philippians","chapter":1,"verses":"9-10"}],"citation":"Phil. 1:9-10."}]}